      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "--- Render rich text safely\n---- Don't use dangerouslySetInnerHTML, can cause XSS unless,\ncontent already pass through santizier like DOMPurify\n---- Validate href URL schemes, \n---- Harden outbound link (rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"), prevent window.opener,.\n---- Set content security policy, allowlist that include only product media's CDN\nRestrictive CSPs are especially important for feed products because they render links, \nimages, and embeds from arbitrary third-party sources.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--- Render rich text safely\n---- Don't use dangerouslySetInnerHTML, can cause XSS unless,\ncontent already pass through santizier like DOMPurify\n---- Validate href URL schemes, \n---- Harden outbound link (rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"), prevent window.opener,.\n---- Set content security policy, allowlist that include only product media's CDN\nRestrictive CSPs are especially important for feed products because they render links, \nimages, and embeds from arbitrary third-party sources.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "PX_rQcA7lKEIcxI_qMPh9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 218.86087540852856,
      "y": 6631.86720847872,
      "width": 1374.51904296875,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1E",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1989440778,
      "version": 903,
      "versionNonce": 2033652794,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781634444077,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "****** Rendering image\n1. Use CDN to host and serve image for better performance\n2. Modern image format such as AIVF or WebP for significantly better compression than JPEG or PNG\n   AIVF produce smallest files at a given quality but narrow browser support than webP,\n   pair them with <picture /> fallback chain (AIVF --> WebP --> JPEG/PNG)\n3. <img /> should have alternative \"alt\" tag\n   lmage loading=\"lazy\", use IntersectionObserver to control and load media when it enter the viewport\n4. Image loading based on device screen properties, use srcset or <picture /> to load most suitable image file in current view port\n5. reserve space for image load (width/height) to prevent jumping\n6.Progressive placeholders: Use blurred previews or LQIP/BlurHash-style placeholders so users get immediate feedback that media is loading.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "****** Rendering image\n1. Use CDN to host and serve image for better performance\n2. Modern image format such as AIVF or WebP for significantly better compression than JPEG or PNG\n   AIVF produce smallest files at a given quality but narrow browser support than webP,\n   pair them with <picture /> fallback chain (AIVF --> WebP --> JPEG/PNG)\n3. <img /> should have alternative \"alt\" tag\n   lmage loading=\"lazy\", use IntersectionObserver to control and load media when it enter the viewport\n4. Image loading based on device screen properties, use srcset or <picture /> to load most suitable image file in current view port\n5. reserve space for image load (width/height) to prevent jumping\n6.Progressive placeholders: Use blurred previews or LQIP/BlurHash-style placeholders so users get immediate feedback that media is loading.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
