      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781642172816,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "** Listener: allows the editor to inform the developer when a certain operation has occurred.\n** Transform: mechanism to respond to changes within the editor before reconciliation happens. \nMultiple transforms still lead to a single DOM reconciliation pass.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "** Listener: allows the editor to inform the developer when a certain operation has occurred.\n** Transform: mechanism to respond to changes within the editor before reconciliation happens. \nMultiple transforms still lead to a single DOM reconciliation pass.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
