      "updated": 1781645209063,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "// <strong>Tarzan </strong><strong><u>and</u></strong><u> Jane</u>\n```\n<TextNode text=\"Tarzan \" format={[\"bold\"]} />\n<TextNode text=\"and\" format={[\"bold\", \"underline\"]} />\n<TextNode text=\" Jane\" format={[\"underline\"]} />\n```",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "// <strong>Tarzan </strong><strong><u>and</u></strong><u> Jane</u>\n```\n<TextNode text=\"Tarzan \" format={[\"bold\"]} />\n<TextNode text=\"and\" format={[\"bold\", \"underline\"]} />\n<TextNode text=\" Jane\" format={[\"underline\"]} />\n```",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
